 7 │
 8 │ Plain paragraph with **bold**, *italic*, ***both***,
   ┆ ~~strike~~, `inline code`, and a
   ┆ [link](https://example.com).
 9 │ Literal tags must stay literal: [red]not red[-] and
   ┆ [::b]not bold[::-] and [#00ff00]no green[-].
10 │
11 │ > A blockquote line
12 │ > with **bold** inside
13 │
14 │ 1. First numbered
